\section{Experiments}
\label{sec:experiments}
%=============================================================================

We evaluate \ours{} on the SafeLIBERO benchmark and standard LIBERO tasks to answer four questions: (1) Does internalized collision awareness improve safety without sacrificing task success? (2) How does \ours{} compare to post-hoc safety methods that operate at inference time? (3) Which components of our training objective are essential? (4) How does the collision-shaping loss interact with the flow-matching training dynamics?

%-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
\subsection{Experimental Setup}
\label{sec:setup}
%-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

